Well, I'd give the box to the robot. I'd train him to copy the
sensor and drop it on the zero. I'd erase the zero from the
robot's thought bubble. Then I'd give the box back to the robot,
stand up, and go outside. I'd wait 3 seconds before coming back in the house and
sitting down again.

